  "details": "In the attached video, I try to to set Primary Style as Object and Secondary Style as Furry for a new Avatar Dynamics Robot Avatar PC sample avatar upload in a new project with nothing but SDK - Avatars 3.10.5, but after the upload finishes both styles end up being Not Specified instead of the chosen information.\n\nEditing primary and secondary styles from the SDK works for existing uploads, but for new uploads.\n\nAffected SDK versions tested: 3.9.0 (minimum for new uploads), 3.10.3, 3.10.4, 3.10.5 (latest). Affects all avatars. I've run into this issue for some six months now, every week.\n\nBehavior in SDK 3.9.0 today is slightly different, but still buggy: In the SDK it shows the Primary Style is set to the chosen Secondary Style, and the Secondary Style as Not Specified, but after checking the VRChat Home website or tabbing in/out of Builder tab it goes back to Not Specified like in SDK 3.10.5.",
